| riscos-mesa DispmanX compatibility test, full screen: double-click to run. It
| runs over the desktop for 5 seconds (like Raspberry Pi programs, it does not
| multitask), then the desktop is redrawn. Results are saved in this directory.
Dir <Obey$Dir>
Set DispmanX$Display full
Run dmxtest -n -o dmx-native
Unset DispmanX$Display
